{"total_count":14,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/22690","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/22690/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/22690/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/22690/events","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/22690","id":4859545771,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAB0Los7wZPtB","number":22690,"title":"Fix keyed iterator value lifetime across reentrant key() calls","user":{"login":"PuH4ck3rX","id":160733240,"node_id":"U_kgDOCZSYOA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160733240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PuH4ck3rX","html_url":"https://github.com/PuH4ck3rX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PuH4ck3rX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PuH4ck3rX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PuH4ck3rX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PuH4ck3rX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PuH4ck3rX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PuH4ck3rX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PuH4ck3rX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PuH4ck3rX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PuH4ck3rX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3045702973,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDQ1NzAyOTcz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Category:%20Engine","name":"Category: Engine","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3611297215,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAB0Los7XQAW_","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Extension:%20spl","name":"Extension: spl","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7494444148,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAB0Los8AAAABvrQkdA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/ABI%20break","name":"ABI break","color":"B60205","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-11T00:09:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T17:37:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/pulls/22690","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/22690","diff_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/22690.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/22690.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Keyed iterator consumers fetch the current value before fetching the key. Fetching the key may call user code, and a reentrant key() implementation can advance a RecursiveIteratorIterator far enough to destroy the child zend_user_iterator that owns the cached current-value zval. iterator_to_array() and keyed foreach then continue using the borrowed pointer.\n\nThis change copies the current zval before invoking get_current_key() in both consumers:\n\n- spl_iterator_to_array_apply() uses the retained value for insertion and releases it on success or exception.\n- zend_fe_fetch_object_helper retains the value across key lookup and releases it after CV or temporary-result assignment.\n\nThe generated VM executor is updated accordingly.\n\nThe regression test deterministically replaces the destroyed child iterator with a same-layout IteratorIterator. Before the fix, iterator_to_array() and both foreach assignment forms consume the replacement value; after the fix, they preserve the value fetched before key() reentry.\n\nChecks performed:\n\n- Built PHP 8.4 with ASan and UBSan, with opcache JIT disabled.\n- The new regression test passed.\n- 7 reduced reproducer scripts completed without sanitizer findings.\n- 47 targeted foreach and iterator tests passed.\n- The complete SPL test suite passed on the native WSL filesystem: 764 passed, 10 skipped, 1 expected failure, 0 failed.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/22690/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/22690/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/23268","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/23268/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/23268/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/23268/events","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/23268","id":5148222312,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAB0Los7-7JoB","number":23268,"title":"Fix GH-17773: Array element initialised by reference returned from a function","user":{"login":"matthiasgoergens","id":57026,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MDI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57026?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthiasgoergens","html_url":"https://github.com/matthiasgoergens","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthiasgoergens/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthiasgoergens/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthiasgoergens/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthiasgoergens/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthiasgoergens/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthiasgoergens/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthiasgoergens/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthiasgoergens/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthiasgoergens/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3045702973,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDQ1NzAyOTcz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Category:%20Engine","name":"Category: Engine","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3685479977,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAB0Los7bq_Yp","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Category:%20Optimizer","name":"Category: Optimizer","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7494444148,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAB0Los8AAAABvrQkdA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/ABI%20break","name":"ABI break","color":"B60205","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-14T04:11:29Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T06:53:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/pulls/23268","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/23268","diff_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/23268.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/23268.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Initialising an array element with a reference returned by a function, e.g.\n`[&foo()]`, is rejected at compile time although ordinary reference assignment\naccepts it. Allow user-function call results in this source position while\nkeeping the remaining source-side safeguards of reference assignment.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/23268/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/23268/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/20848","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/20848/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/20848/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/20848/events","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/20848","id":3784908512,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAB0Los67ta__","number":20848,"title":"[PFA 2/n] Support PFA functionality","user":{"login":"arnaud-lb","id":365207,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NTIwNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/365207?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaud-lb","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaud-lb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaud-lb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaud-lb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaud-lb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaud-lb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaud-lb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaud-lb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaud-lb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaud-lb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaud-lb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":148912247,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDg5MTIyNDc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/RFC","name":"RFC","color":"c7def8","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":303477056,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDM0NzcwNTY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Category:%20Build%20System","name":"Category: Build System","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3045702973,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDQ1NzAyOTcz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Category:%20Engine","name":"Category: Engine","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3611288125,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAB0Los7XP-I9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Extension:%20opcache","name":"Extension: opcache","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3611297679,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAB0Los7XQAeP","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Extension:%20standard","name":"Extension: standard","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3685479977,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAB0Los7bq_Yp","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Category:%20Optimizer","name":"Category: Optimizer","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7494444148,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAB0Los8AAAABvrQkdA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/ABI%20break","name":"ABI break","color":"B60205","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-01-06T12:02:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T13:31:26Z","closed_at":"2026-07-17T08:09:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/pulls/20848","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/20848","diff_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/20848.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/20848.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-17T08:09:23Z"},"body":"RFC: https://wiki.php.net/rfc/partial_function_application_v2\r\n\r\nThis follows https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/20717. This implements most of the RFC, except [PFAs in constant expressions](https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/22785), and [some optimization](https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/22829).\r\n\r\nI wanted to split this PR more, but I didn't find a way to achieve this that makes sense.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA partial application is compiled to the usual sequence of function call\r\nopcodes (`INIT_FCALL`, `SEND_VAR`, etc), but the sequence ends with a\r\n`CALLABLE_CONVERT_PARTIAL` opcode instead of `DO_FCALL`, similarly to\r\nfirst class callables. Placeholders are compiled to `SEND_PLACEHOLDER` opcodes:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$f = f($a, ?)\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n0001 INIT_FCALL f\r\n0002 SEND_VAR CV($a)\r\n0003 SEND_PLACEHOLDER\r\n0004 CV($f) = CALLABLE_CONVERT_PARTIAL\r\n```\r\n\r\n`SEND_PLACEHOLDER` sets the argument slot type to `_IS_PLACEHOLDER`.\r\n\r\n`CALLABLE_CONVERT_PARTIAL` uses the information available on the stack to\r\ncreate a Closure and return it, consuming the stack frame in the process\r\nlike an internal function call.\r\n\r\nWe create the Closure by generating the relevant AST and compiling it to an\r\nop_array.\r\n\r\nThe op_array is cached in the Opcache SHM and inline caches. The SHM key is prefixed with `pfa://` to avoid any collision with actual files. When Opcache is disabled, we cache PFA op_arrays a global hash table. This is mainly useful for polymorphic PFAs, as the inline cache stores only a single entry.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/20848/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/20848/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/20554","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/20554/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/20554/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/20554/events","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/issues/20554","id":3653475358,"node_id":"I_kwDOAB0Los7Zw5we","number":20554,"title":"gcc and latest gibc compile errors","user":{"login":"osevan","id":77795961,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3Nzk1OTYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77795961?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/osevan","html_url":"https://github.com/osevan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osevan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osevan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osevan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osevan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osevan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osevan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osevan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osevan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osevan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":148912283,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDg5MTIyODM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"E99695","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3611416941,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAB0Los7XQdlt","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Status:%20Needs%20Triage","name":"Status: Needs Triage","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-11-22T00:21:54Z","updated_at":"2025-11-22T22:26:26Z","closed_at":"2025-11-22T22:26:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Description\n\n[debian]) sid, custom compiled glibc from git master\n\n\n\ni receive with 8.5 compile errors\n\n```\n/root/compile/php8.5-build/php-8.5.0/sapi/cli/php_cli_server.c: In function ‘get_status_string’:\n/root/compile/php8.5-build/php-8.5.0/sapi/cli/php_cli_server.c:310:16: warning: assignment discards ‘const’ qualifier from pointer target type [-Wdiscarded-qualifiers]\n  310 |         result = bsearch(&needle, http_status_map, http_status_map_len, sizeof(needle), status_comp);\n      |                ^\n```\n\nthanks and \n\nbest regards\n\n### PHP Version\n\n```plain\nphp 8.5\n```\n\n### Operating System\n\ndebian sid","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/20554/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/20554/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/14903","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/14903/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/14903/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/14903/events","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/14903","id":2400683335,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAB0Los509rnu","number":14903,"title":"Fix GH-14873: PHP 8.4 min function fails on typed integer","user":{"login":"ndossche","id":7771979,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NzE5Nzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7771979?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche","html_url":"https://github.com/ndossche","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3611288125,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAB0Los7XP-I9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Extension:%20opcache","name":"Extension: opcache","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3685479977,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAB0Los7bq_Yp","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Category:%20Optimizer","name":"Category: Optimizer","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2024-07-10T12:52:49Z","updated_at":"2024-07-12T22:28:32Z","closed_at":"2024-07-12T22:28:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/pulls/14903","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/14903","diff_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/14903.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/14903.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The problem is that this line in the VM: `ZVAL_NULL(result);` changes the type of arg1 as well, because after the DFA pass the result and input both use CV0($result).\r\nWe should not contract assignments with CVs in frameless calls with arguments.\r\nAn older attempt is found at GH-14876 that tried to modify the VM/JIT.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/14903/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/14903/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/12452","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/12452/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/12452/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/12452/events","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/issues/12452","id":1946288398,"node_id":"I_kwDOAB0Los50AgEO","number":12452,"title":"Allow modifying readonly promoted properties in constructor","user":{"login":"rentalhost","id":421851,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTg1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/421851?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rentalhost","html_url":"https://github.com/rentalhost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rentalhost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rentalhost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rentalhost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rentalhost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rentalhost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rentalhost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rentalhost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rentalhost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rentalhost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":148912334,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDg5MTIzMzQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Feature","name":"Fea