itle":"Fix another use-after-free with static properties/destructors","user":{"login":"iluuu1994","id":1752683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTI2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1752683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iluuu1994","html_url":"https://github.com/iluuu1994","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iluuu1994/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iluuu1994/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iluuu1994/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iluuu1994/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iluuu1994/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iluuu1994/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iluuu1994/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iluuu1994/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iluuu1994/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3045702973,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDQ1NzAyOTcz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Category:%20Engine","name":"Category: Engine","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2023-02-08T14:59:14Z","updated_at":"2023-02-16T23:17:25Z","closed_at":"2023-02-16T23:17:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/pulls/10546","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/10546","diff_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/10546.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/10546.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Also make expression result of assignments consistent, containing the value of the variable from after the destructor has been executed.\r\n\r\nSee GH-10168\r\n\r\nThis will be backported to PHP-8.1 but runs against master CI to prove ASAN passes.\r\n\r\n/cc @nielsdos (Can't add you as a reviewer)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10546/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10546/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10500","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10500/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10500/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10500/events","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/10500","id":1570622301,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAB0Los5JPomf","number":10500,"title":"Fix GH-10168: heap-buffer-overflow at zval_undefined_cv ","user":{"login":"ndossche","id":7771979,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NzE5Nzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7771979?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche","html_url":"https://github.com/ndossche","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndossche/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3045702973,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDQ1NzAyOTcz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Category:%20Engine","name":"Category: Engine","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2023-02-03T23:40:05Z","updated_at":"2023-02-07T20:41:50Z","closed_at":"2023-02-07T20:41:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/pulls/10500","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/10500","diff_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/10500.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/10500.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/php/php-src/issues/10168\r\n\r\ncc'ing @iluuu1994 since he also was involved in the issue report\r\n\r\nThe problem is that we're using the variable_ptr in the opcode handler\r\n*after* it has already been destroyed. The solution is to delay\r\nexecuting the destructors until after the variable_ptr is used.\r\nTo accomplish this we introduce 2 new API functions:\r\n* zend_assign_to_variable_delay_garbage_handling(); and\r\n* zend_assign_to_variable_handle_garbage() that allows users to delay\r\nthe garbage handling. zend_assign_to_variable() is now a wrapper for\r\nthose such that there is no BC break.\r\n\r\nWe only have to apply this to ASSIGN_DIM and ASSIGN. That's because the\r\nothers rely on properties, in which case the variable_ptr can't be\r\ndestroyed.\r\n\r\nThe first commit fixes the bug, the second one adds a regression test.\r\nComparing the performance before and after this fix using Valgrind on\r\nZend/bench.php.\r\nInstruction counts yields 3,339,632,671 before and 3,340,132,746 after.\r\nThe difference is only a performance decrease of ~0.015%, which seems\r\nnegligible.\r\n\r\n**Additional notes**\r\nI do have a local, experimental, patchset that improves performance of ZEND_ASSIGN and even results in a net win, but that's kinda unrelated to this PR and probably master-only material. Just thought I'd mention it since I did measurements of VM performance's tiny decrease.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10500/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10500/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10168","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10168/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10168/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10168/events","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/issues/10168","id":1511245483,"node_id":"I_kwDOAB0Los5aE8ar","number":10168,"title":"heap-buffer-overflow at zval_undefined_cv","user":{"login":"Changochen","id":18531282,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTMxMjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18531282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changochen","html_url":"https://github.com/Changochen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changochen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changochen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changochen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changochen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changochen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changochen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changochen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changochen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changochen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":148912283,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDg5MTIyODM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"E99695","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3611416941,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAB0Los7XQdlt","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Status:%20Needs%20Triage","name":"Status: Needs Triage","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2022-12-26T21:07:36Z","updated_at":"2023-02-08T00:27:56Z","closed_at":"2023-02-08T00:27:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Description\n\nThe following code:\r\n\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\nclass test\r\n{\r\n    protected $_id;\r\n    static $instances;\r\n    public function __construct($id) {\r\n      11 < self::$instances[$this->_id] = $this;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function __destruct() { unset(self::$instances[$this->_id]);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\nnew test(2);\r\nnew test(2);\r\nnew test(3);\r\n?>\r\n```\r\n\r\nResulted in this output:\r\n```\r\n./php-fuzz-execute poc1.php\r\nINFO: Running with entropic power schedule (0xFF, 100).\r\nINFO: Seed: 2128458864\r\nINFO: Loaded 1 modules   (147832 inline 8-bit counters): 147832 [0x1d60c20, 0x1d84d98),\r\nINFO: Loaded 1 PC tables (147832 PCs): 147832 [0x1d84d98,0x1fc6518),\r\n./php-fuzz-execute: Running 1 inputs 1 time(s) each.\r\nRunning: poc1.php\r\n=================================================================\r\n==2827130==ERROR: AddressSanitizer: heap-buffer-overflow on address 0x602000002108 at pc 0x00000120a6bf bp 0x7fffffffd8e0 sp 0x7fffffffd8d8\r\nREAD of size 8 at 0x602000002108 thread T0\r\n```\r\n\r\nGit commit: ff42cb0c0e8723383135dd33fd9415248a70726b\r\n\n\n### PHP Version\n\n8.3.0-dev\n\n### Operating System\n\n_No response_","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10168/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10168/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10556","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10556/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10556/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10556/events","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/10556","id":1579604402,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAB0Los5JtWFR","number":10556,"title":"Zend/zend_execute: clear reference before calling dtor","user":{"login":"MaxKellermann","id":1443144,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDMxNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1443144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxKellermann","html_url":"https://github.com/MaxKellermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxKellermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxKellermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxKellermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxKellermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxKellermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxKellermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxKellermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxKellermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxKellermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":20,"created_at":"2023-02-10T12:26:22Z","updated_at":"2023-03-07T13:25:18Z","closed_at":"2023-02-10T20:15:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/pulls/10556","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/10556","diff_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/10556.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/10556.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"If we don't do this, then `zend_objects_store_del()` will call the PHP destructor, which may then recurse into `zend_objects_store_del()`, leading to a use-after-free / double-free bug.\r\n\r\nFixes failures of `Zend/tests/gh10168_3.phpt` (added recently by 71ddede5655) which, depending on the timing, can trigger the recursive zend_objects_store_del() call.\r\n\r\nThis is similar to commit a057f060e864ff2\r\n\r\n@dstogov @nielsdos ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10556/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/10556/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/4982","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/4982/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/4982/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/4982/events","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/4982","id":534449514,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0MzUwMzQ1MDY1","number":4982,"title":"Infer value is not undef within foreach","user":